# Track-D Temporary Checkpoint — Exp38 through Exp42

Date: 2026-08-13

Purpose: compact temporary checkpoint for Track-D. Later fold into `docs/GOLD_DISCOVERY_HISTORY.md` and delete this file. Historical OOS has been repeatedly inspected; runtime promotion remains `NONE`; Exp27 remains untouched.

