## Shared exact backbone

```text
parent sign = sign(parent_close-parent_open)
TRUE FULL onset = current FULL
                  AND exact 5-minute M5 contiguity
                  AND current FULL state != previous state
```

Frozen Exp20/21 universe:

```text
events=5209
L1 eligible=4786
raw touches=2588
unique touches=2310
OUTSIDE_15=1091
active L2=1013
raw dynamic rows=9826
unique dynamic rows=9667

TRAIN      5612 states / 596 episodes / 207 days
VALIDATION 1959 / 204 / 80
TEST       2096 / 212 / 73
```

Any guard mismatch => abort before score.

