## Exp40 — Multi-Horizon Competing Risk — FULL PASS

Frozen horizons: `15/30/60/120m`.
Target: `NO_EXIT / ADVANCE first / RECAPTURE first`, using future M5 CLOSE against fixed starting L1/L2.

Models fit TRAIN-only separately by horizon:

```text
CONST_H
POSITION_H = geo_logit(CorridorPosition)
SEMI_H     = geo_logit(CorridorPosition) + log1p(DwellBars)
```

