## Exp42 — Directional Orientation Transport Stress — STRICT FAIL / POSITION PASS

Frozen question: does the exact Exp41 shared law transport separately on `FULL_UP` and `FULL_DOWN` with no side-specific refit, coefficient, interaction or recalibration?

### Implementation abort

The first runner aborted before fit/score because intended `_, p = X.shape` was split into two statements. All guards had passed. Corrected runner changed implementation only to `p = X.shape[1]`; frozen science remained unchanged. The abort has no scientific weight.

### Exact reproduction

Corrected run reproduced backbone, Exp20/21 splits, Exp41 cells, person-period counts, shared coefficients and pooled scores before directional scoring.

### Directional coverage

```text
TRAIN      FULL_UP    12355/12900 = 95.78% | 155 days
TRAIN      FULL_DOWN   9326/ 9548 = 97.67% | 136 days
VALIDATION FULL_UP     4946/ 5108 = 96.83% |  60 days
VALIDATION FULL_DOWN   2631/ 2728 = 96.44% |  50 days
TEST       FULL_UP     3294/ 3328 = 98.98% |  48 days
TEST       FULL_DOWN   4714/ 5056 = 93.24% |  55 days

EXP42_DIRECTIONAL_COVERAGE_STATUS = PASS
```

### Gate A — POSITION_SURV vs BASE_SURV

All 8 required cells passed:

```text
FULL_UP
VAL  Brier +0.069481861 CI[+0.054100740,+0.090630389]
VAL  LL    +0.122427403 CI[+0.095841095,+0.157387584]
TEST Brier +0.083056809 CI[+0.052242420,+0.116816723]
TEST LL    +0.153321640 CI[+0.102127660,+0.208578473]

FULL_DOWN
VAL  Brier +0.055694102 CI[+0.030473750,+0.092179533]
VAL  LL    +0.104281323 CI[+0.060593513,+0.165807684]
TEST Brier +0.051153685 CI[+0.028903912,+0.081840188]
TEST LL    +0.105748105 CI[+0.071689001,+0.153338802]

DIRECTIONAL_POSITION_TRANSPORT = PASS
```

This strengthens `CorridorPosition` as an oriented structural coordinate for WHICH boundary across both directional environments.

### Gate B — SEMI_SURV vs POSITION_SURV

7/8 required cells passed. Single frozen failure:

```text
FULL_UP
VAL  Brier +0.027203943 CI[-0.000697083,+0.058845588] P(gain>0)=97.17% FAIL
VAL  LL    +0.045765281 CI[+0.006816751,+0.090915748] PASS
TEST Brier +0.049818941 CI[+0.011315900,+0.087460504] PASS
TEST LL    +0.068244270 CI[+0.001882444,+0.127311083] PASS

FULL_DOWN
VAL  Brier +0.033749932 CI[+0.004651520,+0.068385328] PASS
VAL  LL    +0.045422119 CI[+0.006422495,+0.092879098] PASS
TEST Brier +0.038527860 CI[+0.008100386,+0.072780030] PASS
TEST LL    +0.057139566 CI[+0.013066197,+0.105741821] PASS

DIRECTIONAL_DWELL_TRANSPORT = FAIL
```

Point gain remained positive in the failed cell, but the preregistered criterion required CI95 lower bound >0. No rescue.

Diagnostics: every frozen horizon had positive point gain for both nested gates in both directions, Validation and TEST. Dwell again improved EXIT AUC materially while SIDE AUC changed little. These diagnostics do not rescue the formal gate.

### Formal verdict

```text
EXP42_DIRECTIONAL_COVERAGE_STATUS = PASS
DIRECTIONAL_POSITION_TRANSPORT = PASS
DIRECTIONAL_DWELL_TRANSPORT = FAIL
ORIENTED_SHARED_SURVIVAL_LAW = FAIL
EXP42_FORMAL_STATUS = FAIL
EXP41_STATUS = PRESERVED_FULL_PASS
EXP27 = UNTOUCHED
RUNTIME_PROMOTION = NONE
```

### Scientific interpretation

Exp42 does not erase Exp41. `CorridorPosition` transported cleanly across FULL_UP/FULL_DOWN with no side-specific fitting. Dwell remained directionally consistent and passed 7/8 strict cells, but exact directional invariance was not established.

Preferred wording:

```text
CorridorPosition: WHICH SIDE; directional transport PASS.
Dwell: WHEN/WHETHER EXIT; pooled shared-law PASS, exact directional invariance not established.
```

Current parsimonious Track-D representation:

```text
ACTIVE STRUCTURAL FRONTIER
  -> CURRENT ACTIVE CORRIDOR
  -> CorridorPosition
  +  Dwell
  +  elapsed future time k
  -> shared competing-risk survival law
```

Do not claim Markov sufficiency.

### Anti-repeat / anti-rescue

```text
NO side-specific refit
NO bias_sign coefficient or interaction
NO separate UP/DOWN thresholds
NO horizon subset rescue
NO elapsed-step interaction rescue
NO alternate Position/Dwell transform
NO Exp38/39 coordinates
NO D1/Clock/Z/Fib/weekday/Scale/Energy/HMM rescue
NO Validation/TEST refit
NO Exp27 scoring/modification
```

Historical OOS remains exploratory. Runtime promotion = NONE.
